Maintainer: Nick McKay <nick@nau.edu>
Description: Age-uncertain chronology development for paleogeoscientific
    data, including age modeling with Bacon, Bchron, OxCal, and BAM, and
    LiPD (Linked Paleo Data) model infrastructure. Split out of the
    'geoChronR' package; ensemble analysis is provided by the 'ens' package
    and visualization by the 'lipdViz' package.
